      "description": "Title: BMW 520d Sedan (G60) 2024 - The Executive Business Athlete \nDescription:\nElevate your digital showroom with the all-new 2024 BMW 520d (G60). This 3D model captures the essence of the world's most successful business sedan, now evolved with a sharper, more minimalist design language and mild-hybrid diesel efficiency. Perfect for high-end architectural renders and automotive simulations. \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea\ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udd25\nCar Highlights:\nThe G60 generation redefines the executive class with its \"Sport Executive\" presence:\n\n* \ud83d\udca0 Iconic Glow Presence: Features the new, more upright kidney grille with available Iconic Glow contour lighting and twin-signature vertical LED headlights.\n* \ud83c\udfc1 Clean Design Language: Captures the monolithic surfaces, flush-fitting door handles, and the embossed \"5\" on the Hofmeister kink for a premium, modern feel.\n* \ud83d\udcf1 Digital Leadership: Includes a detailed recreation of the BMW Curved Display and the crystalline Interaction Bar that spans the dashboard.",
